WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.880
Atlas. Your whole dev stack, in one file.

2
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.690
Services, ports, health and actions. One atlas.yaml.

3
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.100
Run atlas dev for a fast terminal dashboard.

4
00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:19.990
Search every service with a live match counter. Jump between errors, follow links, filter by level or time.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.847
Atlas Desktop. Every project is a space.

6
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:28.738
Switch spaces in one move. Hide the sidebar, and peek it back.

7
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.593
A GPU terminal with ligatures, color emoji and inline images.

8
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:40.999
A live project panel. Health, CPU and memory, as it happens.

9
00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:49.065
Logs you can search. Regex, levels, time ranges. Find the error in seconds.

10
00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:57.609
Agents in their own worktrees. See who's working, blocked, or done.

11
00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:07.006
MCP is built in. Your agent sees the same stack you do.

12
00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.522
Atlas is open source. Install it today.
